T-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 주제 : 독도</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 발표 방법 : 꽁트, 연극, 뮤지컬, 노래 등 다양한 형태로 발표 가능</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 발표 시간 : 10분 내외</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;○ 시상 및 특전</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 상장 (경북도지사상, 대구대 총장상 등) 및 상금</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 특전 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">본선 참가팀 및 인솔자에게 울릉도 및 독도 탐방기회 부여</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; ○ 예선 : 본선 진출 12개팀 선발을 위해 필요한 경우 예선 실시</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 일시 : 2013. 6. 14(금) 14:00</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 심사방법 : 서류심사</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 신청</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">접수기간 : 2013. 5. 1(화) ~ 5. 31(목)</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;나. 참가대상 : 전국 대학 외국인 학생 (팀당 3명~4명으로 구성, 팀별 신</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">청)&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; -&nbsp; 제출서류 : 참가 신청서, 발표 원고(지정서식 별도로 없으며 A4용지로</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">쇄),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">PowerPoint 발표자료(A4 용지로 인쇄), 재학증명서, 외국인등록</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 증 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">사본 각 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-S